  "2026-09-28T05:47:28.714Z","harness:codex","{\"text\": \"Duplicate check 2026-09-28: complete 2826-item all-status metadata/history corpus and keyword AND searches for registry installer timeout diagnostics, installation retries, and subprocess error installer. Existing published-metadata propagation owner pm-wzmbvn concerns npm view visibility, not lost install subprocess diagnostics. Existing global reinstall owner pm-ir9vqy concerns missing executable, not acceptance failure classification. Sources: scripts/release/utils.mjs runCommand and scripts/release/verify-installed-agent-session.mjs installAndRun; https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/36377133727 and recovery https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/36380136948.\"}"
